// 시험용 PNG 만들기(단색 바탕 + 왼쪽 위 사분면만 다른 색). 브라우저가 실제로 그릴 수 있는 올바른 파일이다.
import { deflateSync } from "node:zlib";

const TABLE = (() => {
  const t = new Uint32Array(256);
  for (let n = 0; n < 256; n++) {
    let c = n;
    for (let k = 0; k < 8; k++) c = c & 1 ? 0xedb88320 ^ (c >>> 1) : c >>> 1;
    t[n] = c >>> 0;
  }
  return t;
})();
function crc32(bytes: Uint8Array): number {
  let c = 0xffffffff;
  for (const b of bytes) c = TABLE[(c ^ b) & 0xff]! ^ (c >>> 8);
  return (c ^ 0xffffffff) >>> 0;
}
function chunk(type: string, data: Uint8Array): Uint8Array {
  const out = new Uint8Array(12 + data.length);
  const view = new DataView(out.buffer);
  view.setUint32(0, data.length);
  out.set(new TextEncoder().encode(type), 4);
  out.set(data, 8);
  view.setUint32(8 + data.length, crc32(out.subarray(4, 8 + data.length)));
  return out;
}

export function makePng(width: number, height: number, base: [number, number, number] = [226, 220, 255], corner: [number, number, number] = [122, 91, 255]): Uint8Array {
  const ihdr = new Uint8Array(13);
  const view = new DataView(ihdr.buffer);
  view.setUint32(0, width);
  view.setUint32(4, height);
  ihdr.set([8, 2, 0, 0, 0], 8); // 8비트 RGB
  const raw = new Uint8Array(height * (1 + width * 3));
  for (let y = 0; y < height; y++) {
    const row = y * (1 + width * 3);
    for (let x = 0; x < width; x++) raw.set(x < width / 2 && y < height / 2 ? corner : base, row + 1 + x * 3);
  }
  const parts = [new Uint8Array([137, 80, 78, 71, 13, 10, 26, 10]), chunk("IHDR", ihdr), chunk("IDAT", new Uint8Array(deflateSync(raw))), chunk("IEND", new Uint8Array(0))];
  const out = new Uint8Array(parts.reduce((n, p) => n + p.length, 0));
  let at = 0;
  for (const p of parts) {
    out.set(p, at);
    at += p.length;
  }
  return out;
}

export const pngBase64 = (width: number, height: number): string => Buffer.from(makePng(width, height)).toString("base64");
